00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:03.156
ALTERNATIVES TO THE FREEWAY WERE

00:02:03.223 --> 00:02:04.824
IDENTIFIED AND THE DECISION WAS

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:07.227
MADE TO HALT THE PLANS FOR THE

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:08.294
