00:02:30.750 --> 00:02:32.585
HOMES FROM CALTRANS AT COST AND

00:02:32.652 --> 00:02:33.720
SELL THE PROPERTIES AS IS AT

00:02:33.786 --> 00:02:36.155
MARKET RATE, WITH THE PROCEEDS

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:37.257
FROM THE SALE OF THESE

00:02:37.323 --> 00:02:38.324
PROPERTIES, THE CITY IS REQUIRED

00:02:38.391 --> 00:02:40.026
TO DEVELOP OR ACQUIRE AFFORDABLE

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.594
HOUSING FOR VERY LOW, LOW OR

00:02:41.661 --> 00:02:44.964
